# Template for .env — copy this to `.env` and fill in the real key.
#
# `.env` is gitignored and is NOT in this repository. It is needed on whatever
# machine runs `npm run build`, because Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed variables
# into the bundle at build time. Without it the enquiry form builds fine but
# posts with an empty X-API-Key, and KSOU's API answers 401.
#
# The site is deployed to IIS at onlineprogramme.ksoumysuru.ac.in/ksou_test/,
# the same origin as the enquiry API, so the form posts to it directly from
# the browser — no proxy, no CORS. That also means the key is public on the
# deployed site by necessity. It is still kept out of this public repo: a key
# in git history is permanent and is harvested automatically.
#
# Ask KSOU for the current key; do not invent one.

VITE_API_URL=https://onlineprogramme.ksoumysuru.ac.in/ksouapi/api/enquiries
VITE_API_KEY=ask-KSOU-for-this-value
